        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "getting-to-tarn-razorlor:14ca61n",
          "html": "Using a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ring_of_slaying\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ring of slaying</a> will teleport the player directly to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Lair_of_Tarn_Razorlor_(dungeon)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tarn&#39;s lair</a>, skipping most of the quest.",
          "text": "Using a Ring of slaying will teleport the player directly to Tarn's lair, skipping most of the quest.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "getting-to-tarn-razorlor:14ca61n:w732of",
              "html": "Alternatively, enter level 1 of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Abandoned_mine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">abandoned mine</a> by climbing over the mine cart west of the secret entrance and crawling down the cart tunnel.",
              "text": "Alternatively, enter level 1 of the abandoned mine by climbing over the mine cart west of the secret entrance and crawling down the cart tunnel.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "getting-to-tarn-razorlor:14ca61n:8kod9a",
              "html": "Head north and enter the entrance. Watch for <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Skeleton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">skeletons</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Possessed_pickaxe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">possessed pickaxes</a>.",
              "text": "Head north and enter the entrance. Watch for skeletons and possessed pickaxes.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "getting-to-tarn-razorlor:14ca61n:oks8uh",
              "html": "Navigate the maze, disarm traps along the way or be hit by damage. Watch for skeletons and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Zombie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">zombies</a> throughout the maze.",
              "text": "Navigate the maze, disarm traps along the way or be hit by damage. Watch for skeletons and zombies throughout the maze.",
